            <div class="role-step-num">03</div>
            <div class="role-step-text">Serve signed offers. Ed25519 signatures prevent intermediary tampering. Stateless verification.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="role-step">
            <div class="role-step-num">04</div>
            <div class="role-step-text">Plug in your billing adapter — Stripe, x402, or custom. RAMP handles the transaction; you handle settlement.</div>
